# Implementation Plan: Enterprise AI SQL Agent Upgrade

Refactor and enhance the existing Python project to transform it into a production-grade, schema-aware, offline Enterprise AI SQL Agent with a modern ChatGPT-style chat interface, dynamic schema auto-extraction, high-priority schema RAG, AST security validation, SQL query optimization, and fast memory caching.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Local Offline Model**: The agent relies on local Ollama / llama.cpp models (`qwen2.5-coder:7b`) and sentence-transformers (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`). No external cloud APIs are used.
> - **Target Scope Restriction**: Strictly 8 tables are allowed (`users`, `wallet_transaction`, `sku_inventories`, `companies`, `machine_details`, `withdrawal_request`, `automatic_transactions`, `automate`). All other tables are ignored and blocked.
> - **Database Operations**: Only read-only operations (`SELECT`, `SHOW`, `DESCRIBE`, `EXPLAIN`) are allowed. Unsafe SQL statements (`INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE`, `DROP`, `ALTER`, `TRUNCATE`, `CREATE`, `EXEC`) are blocked via AST parsing.

